cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  netavail is a Rust implementation of algorithms published in the papers
  listed under "references". If you use netavail in your research, please cite
  the paper(s) for the algorithms you used (see the "Citing" section of the
  README).
title: netavail
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MichaelChennn/netavail"
authors:
